{"suttaId":"tha-ap219","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7705,7723],"vripara":"31"},"segments":{"tha-ap219:0.3":"Tālavaṇṭadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap219:1.1":"“Tālavaṇṭaṃ mayā dinnaṃ, tissassādiccabandhuno;","tha-ap219:1.3":"Gimhanibbāpanatthāya, pariḷāhopasantiyā.","tha-ap219:2.1":"“Sannibbāpemi rāgaggiṃ, dosaggiñca taduttariṃ;","tha-ap219:2.3":"Nibbāpemi ca mohaggiṃ, tālavaṇṭassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap219:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap219:3.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap219:4.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap219:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, tālavaṇṭassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap219:5.1":"“Tesaṭṭhimhi ito kappe, mahānāmasanāmako;","tha-ap219:5.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap219:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap219:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tālavaṇṭadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap219:8.1":"Tālavaṇṭadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
